WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
How to create your Swift Agents widget — from registration to live

2
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:11.000
Step 1 of 7 — Register your company at swiftagents.org

3
00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Enter your company name and company email

4
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:26.000
Describe what you do, and pick your customer volume

5
00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:32.000
Registration is an application — we review every one and reach out

6
00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:39.000
Step 2 of 7 — Once approved, sign in with your company email

7
00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:46.000
We email you a six-digit code. If you can't see it, check spam or junk

8
00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:52.000
Type the code — it submits on the sixth digit

9
00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:59.000
Step 3 of 7 — Set up your company. Give us your website and we'll prefill the rest

10
00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:10.000
Check the company information — name, industry, size, country and timezone

11
00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:20.000
Then your company identity — what you solve, and how you sound

12
00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:28.000
The agents then ask a few questions. It takes about five minutes

13
00:01:28.000 --> 00:01:36.000
Step 4 of 7 — Your widget code stays locked until you're on a plan

14
00:01:36.000 --> 00:01:44.000
Press Upgrade and subscribe. The code unlocks straight after

15
00:01:44.000 --> 00:01:51.000
Step 5 of 7 — Your widget is already here. The snippet is the widget

16
00:01:51.000 --> 00:02:00.000
Choose Widget or Button. Button mode opens the chat from your own button

17
00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:07.000
Press Reveal to unmask your company ID

18
00:02:07.000 --> 00:02:14.000
Copy the snippet

19
00:02:14.000 --> 00:02:21.000
Step 6 of 7 — In Settings, API Keys, press Generate

20
00:02:21.000 --> 00:02:28.000
Copy the key now — it is shown only once

21
00:02:28.000 --> 00:02:37.000
Step 7 of 7 — Paste the snippet into your page, just before the closing body tag

22
00:02:37.000 --> 00:02:43.000
Swap YOUR_API_KEY for the key you generated

23
00:02:43.000 --> 00:02:50.000
That's it — your agent is live on your site
